  "description": "Lee Seung-Hyeon's girlfriend, whom he thought about marrying, suddenly broke up with him. \n\nSeung-Hyeon is uncomfortable around his junior collegue Yun I-Seon, who is rumored to be involved with his ex-girlfriend. Although he consciously tries to distance himself from I-Seon, he is always by Seung-Hyeon's side, so he slowly opens his heart to him. \n\nAt first, I-Seon, who was having a hard time without his brother, was just cute. \"It's normal, right? I can't do anything about it. I'm just acknowledging it.\"\n\nGradually, I-Seon's gaze makes his heart waver.\n\n(Source: BOMTOON, translated)",
